###############################################################################

# - Decision wanted (same as holzenkamp2025 and shanks2022): kernel ridge regression / Gaussian-process potentials have no registry method. Until decided, the Delta-KRR (10-fold CV MAE 0.33 +/- 0.07 kcal/mol; selected fold 0.22 kcal/mol; global harmonic approximation 23.14 +/- 3.57 kcal/mol), reduced 2-mode Delta-KRR and direct KRR models are not encoded.
